<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - March 14.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - March 14.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>			     Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Centro Prop	    15.80    2.20</p>
<p> 2   Telecasters Nqld     15.53    5.15</p>
<p> 3   Bk of Queen	    13.19    6.14</p>
<p> 4   Mt Leyshon Gold	10.64    2.35</p>
<p> 5   Prime Credit Tr	 9.61    1.02</p>
<p> 6   Aust Tour		 9.38    0.80</p>
<p> 7   Prop Income Inv	 9.25    1.09</p>
